  "bio": "NeneCo Tattoo is a highly skilled artist specializing in the black and gray realism style, creating breathtakingly lifelike designs that capture the essence of their subjects. Known for their attention to detail, they transform skin into a canvas of intricate artwork. Operating out of Araguari, Brazil, the studio upholds the utmost standards of cleanliness, ensuring each client's experience is not only satisfying artistically but also hygienic and safe.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Araguari, Minas Gerais, Brazil\n\nTatuador | Estúdio Privado\n                                                                   📍 Araguari-MG \nTatuando não, realizando sonhos.",
